  "description": "This package contains the Reporting module of the Endatix Platform. It provides the reporting bounded context for BI-ready survey exports, including compiled form schemas, flattened submissions and export delivery formats. The module is registered automatically and stays disabled at runtime until the Endatix:FeatureFlags:ReportingModule flag is enabled.\n\n      Endatix Platform is an open-source data collection and management library for .NET.",
